// ---------- people ----------
// Everyone is put together joint by joint at the canvas's own pixels (2× the scene grid): a
// head and torso from the rows above, arms and legs as outlined tubes that bend at the elbow
// and knee. So a hand can reach for the hair, a head can tip back for a yawn, and a planted
// foot stays planted while the body passes over it. Each finished pose is kept as a small
// canvas, so only a new pose costs anything.
const RIG_W = 52, RIG_H = 56, RIG_X = 13, RIG_Y = 12;      // the sprite's corner inside the buffer
